STABLE
------
=== Fix bug where extension could not be dropped
The extension now requires extension_drop. 0.2.0 did not, so before updating from 0.2.0 run `CREATE EXTENSION extension_drop CASCADE;`, then `ALTER EXTENSION "trunklet-format" UPDATE;`.

=== Add optional parameters
A parameter written as `%name%Os` or `%name%OL` may be absent from the parameters, in which case it is treated as NULL. Identifiers (`I`) cannot be optional.

=== Other changes
* `extract_parameters()` returns NULL instead of an error when none of the requested parameters are present.
* Template parse errors report the position in the template.
